WEBVTT

00:45.501 --> 00:53.343
The red light's on The tape is rolling They're

00:53.423 --> 01:02.637
telling me what words to say I'm trying to find

01:04.839 --> 01:10.624
the man I was But he gets farther

01:12.966 --> 01:13.887
every day

01:32.169 --> 01:34.771
They want the polish

01:36.032 --> 01:42.336
They want the gleam The safer version

01:44.077 --> 01:53.763
Of the dream But all I hear Is a thin machine

01:55.263 --> 02:03.713
Another part of their big C. It's just a hollow

02:03.833 --> 02:08.237
sound. My voice is in the mix.

02:11.139 --> 02:19.186
But the words are not my own. It's just a hollow

02:19.326 --> 02:23.830
sound. Another plastic fix.

02:26.733 --> 02:46.485
I'm singing all alone.

02:49.547 --> 02:54.790
They're all afraid of the burning cross.

02:57.312 --> 02:58.973
Terrified

03:00.793 --> 03:06.676
