03:09.056 --> 03:20.001
Off the edge Pushing me back From the ledge It's

03:20.061 --> 03:25.443
just a hollow sound My voice is in the mix

03:28.545 --> 03:36.610
But the words are not my own It's just a hollow

03:36.730 --> 03:41.132
sound Another plastic fix

03:44.154 --> 03:47.055
I'm singing all alone

04:37.303 --> 04:39.584
